# Architectural Rules

These rules are mandatory.

1. Domain references nothing.

2. Application references Domain only.

3. Infrastructure references Application and Domain.

4. Strava references Application contracts only.

5. Api references Application only.

6. No project may reference Api.

7. No project may reference Infrastructure abstractions directly.

8. No Strava types may leave the Strava project.

9. No Strava DTOs may enter Domain.

10. No HttpClient usage outside Training.Strava.

11. No EF Core usage outside Training.Infrastructure.

12. Controllers must contain zero business logic.

13. All business decisions belong in Domain or Application.

14. Agents must communicate through Application use cases.

15. Every feature must start with a Domain model before implementation.

16. The platform must remain provider-agnostic.

17. Strava must be replaceable without modifying Domain.

18. Future providers must implement the same contracts.
